        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Explain why the data has no mode.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p28-q16-a-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Every data value is different.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "Each mass occurs once. Every data value is different, so there is no mode.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 8
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q16-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Find the mean mass of the ice hockey players.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p28-q16-b-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\approx93.42\\text{ kg}",
                    "display": false
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{95.2+89.2+98.8+93.4+89.7+94.2}{6}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{560.5}{6}\\text{ kg}\\\\\\bar{x}&\\approx93.42\\text{ kg}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q16-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Find the median mass. Hint: Remember to put the masses in order first.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p28-q16-c-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "93.8\\text{ kg}",
                    "display": false
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "In ascending order: $89.2,\\;89.7,\\;93.4,\\;94.2,\\;95.2,\\;98.8$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{93.4+94.2}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=93.8\\text{ kg}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q16-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "Which, if any, of the averages will change if the heaviest player is replaced by a player of mass 94 kg?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p28-q16-d-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The mean and median change; there is still no mode. The range also changes, but it measures spread rather than an average.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "Replace $98.8\\text{ kg}$ with $94\\text{ kg}$. The new ordered masses are $89.2,\\;89.7,\\;93.4,\\;94,\\;94.2,\\;95.2$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{New mean}&=\\frac{560.5-98.8+94}{6}\\\\\\text{New mean}&=\\frac{555.7}{6}\\text{ kg}\\\\\\text{New mean}&\\approx92.62\\text{ kg}\\\\\\text{New median}&=\\frac{93.4+94}{2}\\\\\\text{New median}&=93.7\\text{ kg}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe mean decreases from approximately $93.42\\text{ kg}$, and the median decreases from $93.8\\text{ kg}$. Every value is still different, so there is still no mode.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Original range}&=98.8-89.2\\\\\\text{Original range}&=9.6\\text{ kg}\\\\\\text{New range}&=95.2-89.2\\\\\\text{New range}&=6\\text{ kg}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe range also changes, but range measures spread rather than an average.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      }
    ]
